## 🧠 INVOICES PAGE PHILOSOPHY

This page answers **one question only**:

> “What’s the status of every invoice?”

Not history.
Not analytics.
Just clarity.

---

# 🧱 PAGE LAYOUT (DESKTOP)

```
┌──── Page Header ─────────────────────┐
│ Invoices        [+ Add Invoice]      │
│ Tabs: All | Due | Overdue | Paid     │
└──────────────────────────────────────┘

┌──── Filters (lightweight) ───────────┐
│ Client ▾  Date ▾  Amount ▾           │
└──────────────────────────────────────┘

┌──── Invoices Table (main) ───────────┐
│ Invoice rows                         │
└──────────────────────────────────────┘
```

Simple. Predictable. Fast.

---

# 1️⃣ PAGE HEADER

### Left:

* **Invoices** (page title)
* Small subtitle:

  > “Track and follow up on customer payments”

### Right:

* **➕ Add Invoice** (primary button)

Even though Add Invoice exists in top nav,
**repeat it here** — convenience beats purity.

---

# 2️⃣ STATUS TABS (VERY IMPORTANT)

Tabs:

* **All**
* **Due**
* **Overdue**
* **Paid**

### Behavior:

* Default → **All**
* Overdue tab shows count badge 🔴
* Paid tab is lower priority (less visual weight)

These tabs replace complex filters.

---

# 3️⃣ LIGHT FILTER BAR (OPTIONAL MVP+)

Only include **3 filters max**:

* Client
* Due date range
* Status

No advanced filtering yet.

---

# 4️⃣ INVOICE TABLE (CORE)

### Columns (don’t add more):

1. Invoice #
2. Client Name
3. Amount
4. Due Date
5. Status
6. Last Follow-up
7. Action

---

### Status design:

* **Paid** → green pill
* **Due** → neutral
* **Overdue** → red pill + days count

Example:

> 🔴 Overdue · 7 days

---

### Action column (single action!)

* **View / Follow-up**

Clicking row OR button → Invoice Detail page

❌ No inline edits
❌ No bulk actions in MVP

---

# 5️⃣ ROW INTERACTION (IMPORTANT DETAIL)

* Whole row clickable
* Hover → subtle highlight
* Overdue rows slightly tinted (very light red)

This subconsciously guides attention.

---

# 6️⃣ EMPTY STATES

### Case 1: No invoices at all

Text:

> “No invoices yet.
> Add your first invoice to start tracking payments.”

Button: **Add Invoice**

---

### Case 2: Filter has no results

Text:

> “No invoices match this filter.”

---

# 🎨 VISUAL STYLE

* Table with lots of white space
* Zebra rows optional
* No heavy borders
* Status pills rounded

Think **finance-grade**, not admin panel.

---

# ❌ WHAT NOT TO PUT HERE

* Payment gateway links
* PDF preview inline
* Reminder rules
* Client notes
* Analytics

Those belong elsewhere.

---

# 🧠 WHY THIS WORKS

* Easy scanning
* Minimal cognitive load
* Clear priority: Overdue > Due > Paid
* Fast access to follow-up action

This page becomes the **daily working list** for finance teams.

---

# 📱 MOBILE BEHAVIOR (BRIEF)

* Tabs become horizontal scroll
* Table → card list
* Each card:

  * Invoice #
  * Amount
  * Status
  * Follow-up button

